<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">Dai-Chin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">Judah</para>
  <para style="toc1">JUDAHA Cayuk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Judah</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jud</para>
  <para style="mt1">JUDAHA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Cayuk</para>
  <para style="imt">Pyenhlüma</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Judaha Cayuk</char> hin akse jah mtheimkhawng u lü jumeikia thawn hlüki msaknaka mcuhmcäinak ni. Kca a jah yuknake üng “Pamhnam naw a khyange üng a jah pet ahun a thihnak angläta phäh ami jumeinak am ngtuk pawh nglät vaia” a jah mcuhmcäinak ahina kca hin <char style="bk">2 Pita</char> am tängkia kyaki.”</para>
  <para style="iot">Amawng Ktawie</para>
  <para style="io1">Pyenhlüma <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JUD 1:1-2">1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Akse jah mtheikiea Ngneisak, mtheinak ja amimäta a cimpyenak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JUD 1:3-16">3-16</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jumeinak üng ami ngkhäng vai mcuhmcäinak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JUD 1:17-23">17-23</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dawnak petnak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JUD 1:24-25">24-25</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:55">Mt 13:55</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:3">Mk 6:3</ref></char>
    </note>Jesuh Khritawa mpya, Jakuka na kei Judah naw,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">Pamhnam naw a jah khü päng khyange, Pa Pamhnama mhläkphyanak ja Jesuh Khritawa kcungvawngnak am xüngseikie veia ka yuk ni.<verse eid="JUD 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2"/>Mpyenmseinak, dimdeihnak ja mhläkphyanak nami khana be se.<verse eid="JUD 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akhya mtheikie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3"/>Ka püi he aw, mi yah khyakhya küikyannaka mawng ning jah yuk law vaia ka ngaih kyaw. Cunüngpi, Pamhnam naw a khyangea üng ahun jumeinak cun angläta phäh a jah peta phäh ngtäknak nami pawh vaia, mcuhmcäinak kca angsüha ka ning jah yuk law vaia ka ktha naki. <verse eid="JUD 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4"/>Khyümhnam am ksingki cun am mi jah ksinga mi ksunga ngpüi law ve u. Ami ngneisak kse cun ami khümphanaka vaia mi Pamhnama bäkhäknaka mawng cun akhyea jah mtheikie ni. Acun he naw mi Mahpa ja Bawipa, Jesuh Khritaw cun makie. Ami yahei vaia mkatnak ta, ahlana khyüh Cangcim naw a na pyen päng ni.<verse eid="JUD 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:51">Ex 12:51</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 14:29">Num 14:29</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 14:30">30</ref></char>
    </note>Acunakyase, nami ksing pänga kya kyaw lü pi, ning jah mcuhmcäinaka ka pyen hlü ta, Isarel khyang mjüe cen Egypt pe üngkhyüh Bawipa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">akhäk naw ta </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jesuh, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tilü ni ami yuk.</char></note> naw a jah küikyan ni. Acunüngpi, ani am jumeiki cun a jah mcimkpyeh be ni. <verse eid="JUD 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6"/>Pamhnam naw a jah peta anaa k’uma am ve hlü lü ami hnün hawihkia khankhawngsä avange pi ngthumkhyah lawa Mhnüp üng a jah mkhuimkha vaia, angsäia mthiyüi am jah khit lü anghmüpnaka ke säiha a jah tak cen jah süm ua. <verse eid="JUD 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:1-24">Gen 19:1-24</ref></char></note>Sodom ja Komorah, ja a pipeia mlüh üngka khyange pi acuna khankhawngsäe akba awmih u lü hnunglanak, khyanga khyucei ihawmpüi lü mkhyekat u se angsäia mei üng mkhihnak ami khamei cen mi vana phäh mcäinak ni ti cen süm ua.<verse eid="JUD 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8"/>Acukba ni, ahina khyange naw amimäta pumsa jah mkhyekatsakia hmuhmdannak ta ve u. Pamhnama johit pi am hnaläü u, khana veki khankhawngsä jomahe pi jah mdihmsuikie. <verse eid="JUD 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:13">Dan 10:13</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 10:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:1">12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:7">Malam 12:7</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 34:6">Deut 34:6</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">c </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 3:2">Zakh 3:2</ref></char></note>Khankhawngsäea mkhawng Mihkhelah hngawh pi acukba am ve. Khawyama dä Mosia yawk u naw bi khai ti lü ani ngcuh üng mkateinaka ngthu am pyen. “Bawipa naw ning kse na se” ti lü ni a pyen. <verse eid="JUD 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10"/>Acunüngpi, ahina khyange naw ta am ami ksing ngkhai cun mdihmsuinak am ngtäkpüikie. Sakyungea mäiha ami ngtüiei lawpüi am ksing u lü, acuna ksingnak naw jah kpyüpye khai. <verse eid="JUD 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-8">Gen 4:3-8</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-35">Num 22:1-35</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">c </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:1-35">Num 16:1-35</ref></char></note>Ihlawka kyühei phyaki ni. Kaihnaha hnu läki he ni. Ngui yah vaia phäh biloki Balaama kba mkhyenak pawh ve u. Korah naw pyen a kpetmjaka kba, pyen kpetmjakie. Koraha cimpyak kba cimpyak acun he. <verse eid="JUD 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12"/>Nglawinak buh pawi nami pawh üng nami ksunga ngkeei vai am ksing u lü mtuihmlehsakie ni. Amimäta phü vai däk ksingki he. Acun he cun khawkhi naw a jawn hü yawhtui ka khawngmei am tängkie ni. A ngthei kcün pha lü am ngtheipaiki thingdung am tängkie ni. Ami ngthei vaia kcün khawksik khye hngawh üngpi am ngtheikia thingdungea kba, a pya mahmaha phukin lü avana thikia thingdung üng tängkie ni. <verse eid="JUD 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13"/>Ngkeeikse aksekhyu ami bi lawh cun, mtüihkhehki tuimpawn nawt lawki mpanglai tui ngnawk üng tängkie ni. A phanak vai hnün am ngtekia aisie am tängkie ni. Amimi phäh Pamhnam naw anghmüpnak säih hnün cun angsäia jah tak petki.<verse eid="JUD 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14-15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 5:18">Gen 5:18</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">21-24</ref></char>
    </note>Adam üngkhyüh ngsawn khyühnak Enawk naw sahma lü a na pyen ta, “Bawipa cun a khankhawngsä ngcim thawng khawkän am kyum law lü avana khana ngthumkhyah law khai. Mhnam kaa mäiha am dawki ami pawhnak naküt ja mhnam kaa mäiha khyangka he naw ani kpetnaka ngthu kyühei phyaki ami pyen naküta phäh acune jah mkhuimkha law khai” a ti.<verse eid="JUD 1:14-15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16"/>Acuna khyange cun aläa ngikcak u lü khyang jah mkateikie. Ami mlungkaw ngnei ksea hnu läki he. Amimät mhlünmtaiei u lü, amimäta dawnak vaia khyang jah mhläki he.<verse eid="JUD 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mcuhmcäinak ja mthehnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17-18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:17-18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 3:3">2Pit 3:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka püi he aw, mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa ngsäe naw ami pyen khawi, “Akpäihnaka kcün üng, ning yaihyünei acun he po law acun he. Khyang he naw mhnam am ksinga mtisa hlü läklam law acun he” ti cen süm ua. <verse eid="JUD 1:17-18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19"/>Ahin he cun ngphüingkyanak pawhkie ni, Ngmüimkhya am takia khyange, ami mlung hlü naw a jah nängeia khyange ni. <verse eid="JUD 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20"/>Acunüngpi, ka püi he aw, nami jumeinak ngcingcaih säih am namimät ngsawngsaei ua. Ngmüimkhya Ngcima johit am ktaiyü ua. <verse eid="JUD 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21"/>Pamhnama mhläkphyanak am namimät ve nglät ua. Angsäia xünnak a ning jah pet vaia phäh mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa mpyenmseinak äpei lü ve ua.<verse eid="JUD 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22"/>Ami mlung uplatkie khana mpyeneinak ta ua. <verse eid="JUD 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23"/>Khyang kce he xünnak ami yah vai mei kdäi üngkhyüh jah kset be lü jah kumei ua. Mceieinak am jah mpyenei ua. Cunüngpi, ami mkhyenak mtisa hlükaw am beki ami suisak ta nami mtuihei vai.<verse eid="JUD 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mküimto lü ktaiyünak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24"/>Jumeinak üng kyukngpänak üngkhyüh, mkhyenak am vekia jekyainak üng a hlüngtainaka maa ning jah cehpüi khawhki, <verse eid="JUD 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25"/>Jah Küikyanki Pamhnam mat däka jotai, dämduh hlüngtainak ja ana cun, Mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritaw üngkhyüh, päih pängki kcüne ja atuh üngkhyüh, angsäia hlüngtai se. Amen.<verse eid="JUD 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1"/>
</usx>
